im in the afternoon the poised [standing] racehorses.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"38:32","t":"And he said, \"Indeed, I gave preference to the love of good [things] over the remembrance of my Lord until it [i.e., the sun] disappeared into the curtain [of darkness].\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"38:33","t":"[He said], \"Return them to me,\" and set about striking [their] legs and necks.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"38:34","t":"And We certainly tried Solomon and placed on his throne a body; then he returned.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"38:35","t":"He said, \"My Lord, forgive me and grant me a kingdom such as will not belong to anyone after me. Indeed, You are the Bestower.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"38:36","t":"So We subjected to him the wind blowing by his command, gently, wherever he directed,","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"38:37","t":"And [also] the devils [of jinn] - every builder and diver.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"38:38","t":"And others bound together in irons.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"38:39","t":"[We said], \"This is Our gift, so grant or withhold without account.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"38:40","t":"And indeed, for him is nearness to Us and a good place of return.","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"38:41","t":"And remember Our servant Job, when he called to his Lord, \"Indeed, Satan has touched me with hardship and torment.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"38:42","t":"[So he was told], \"Strike [the ground] with your foot; this is a [spring for a] cool bath and drink.\"","j":23,"h":46,"s":38,"a":42,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":46,"surahs":[38],"sajdah":false}